# graphify signal-sharpening for perry-starter.
# Merged on top of .gitignore (graphify honors .gitignore automatically) and
# graphify's hard-coded defaults (node_modules, .git, dist, .turbo, .idea, lockfiles…).
# Only the boilerplate that survives those defaults is listed here.

# Generated / compiled
**/.source/**
**/*.gen.ts
source.config.mjs

# Vendored shadcn UI primitives (boilerplate, no app logic)
**/components/ui/**
apps/web/src/components/loader.tsx

# Template placeholders / stock boilerplate
**/content/docs/test.mdx
apps/fumadocs/README.md
**/public/robots.txt

# Config / manifest dumps (stack is already captured in CLAUDE.md)
# Nested copies (graphify's **/ needs a dir component, so it won't hit root files):
**/package.json
**/tsconfig*.json
**/components.json
**/turbo.json
**/postcss.config.*
**/next.config.*
**/.vscode/**
lefthook.yml
# Root-anchored copies of the same (the **/ patterns above skip the repo root):
/package.json
/tsconfig.json
/tsconfig.base.json
/turbo.json
/components.json
/.vscode/
